0..71 Comment "// Descent on the parameter a definition\'s matches take apart (#518). A"
72..147 Comment "// recursive definition descends on the parameter the innermost match above"
148..227 Comment "// each of its claims scrutinises: the first one, with the accumulator after it"
228..304 Comment "// varying from call to call, or a value rebuilt from the match\'s fields, so"
305..382 Comment "// long as it stands below the parameter the match took apart. The parameters"
383..458 Comment "// before the staged one are passed unchanged; descent on two parameters at"
459..513 Comment "// once is the sized rung\'s (#392). What refuses is in"
514..557 Comment "// `../../pathological/data/descent.gandr`."
559..606 Comment "// The naturals and the numerals two and three."
